  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "你相信吗，世界上有一种“没有脚”的鸟，它的一生一直在飞，一辈子只落一次地，它是世界上最孤独的旅人，也是最长情的信徒，它叫北京雨燕，一入秋这几天已经陆续出发了，它们可以在空中连续飞行10个月不落地，睡觉和吃饭都在空中进行，它们从北京出发，最终到达南非高原。在平流层的雨燕，它不需要剧烈的扇动翅膀，它只要稍微张开双翼，风就会托着它往前飞。祝愿诸君，都能飞到人生的平流层。#北京雨燕 #雨燕 #燕子 #治愈力",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_abf33f113a520cdb_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 160.078005,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "Jj,你相信吗？世界上真的有一种没有脚的鸟，它的一生一直在飞，一辈子，只落一次地。她是世界上最孤独的旅人，也是最长情的信徒。她叫北京雨燕，就是当年北京奥运吉祥物妮妮的原型，你知道吗？燕子南飞其实不是飞到我国的南方，而是一直飞到南非。没错，非洲南部什么补给装备都没有，凭借一双小小的翅膀就出发了我们的朋友。北京雨燕一入秋，这几天已经陆续出发了，他们可以在空中连续飞行十个月不落地睡觉、吃饭交配都在空中进行，即便身体仍在飞行。他的大脑却能陷入沉睡。他们从北京出发，经过蒙古到达中亚，再穿越阿拉伯沙漠，渡过红海。最终抵达南非高原海，不到一颗鸡蛋大的重量，飞越欧亚大陆，全程飞行三万里路。经过三十七个国家，里约一夫一妻制，终身只有一个半围，夫妻双方一起穿也山川荒漠。而今年刚出生的雨燕宝宝，要先于父母一步独自前往非洲，从此和父母山高水远，不再相见，在路上。他们要面对的是天敌的捕食，是恶劣的天气，唯一可以依靠的是不返航的勇气和信念。那你知道雨燕为什么能够不落地吗？一直到最近几年，科学家才发现了一个惊人的秘密，他们的飞行高度竟然接近了平流层。大部分生物都生活在对流层，我们会受到重力的拖拽。比如在坐飞机的时候，一旦突破颠簸了，对流层就会在平流层开启定速巡航。而在平流层的雨燕，它不需要剧烈的煽动翅膀，它只需要稍微张开双翼风，就会拖着他往前飞。雨燕在空中飞行的状态很像鸭子，在水里水的浮力会拖着它。我们的人生就像在对流层飞行，这里有太多的干扰，情绪的风暴，信息的噪音、拥挤的竞争，大家都在同一高度盘旋，互相碰撞，互相消耗。如果你一旦飞到了人生的平流层在那里，情绪更稳定，环境更安静，你不再通过剧烈的自我损耗的方式去换取成功。你会发现天空其实很宽，气流其实很温柔。人生是不需要过分努力的，你只需要不断的去筛选匹配自己的环境，然后让自己放松下来，闲下来就可以。就像北京语言一样，推到他的平流层，天空才是他真正的家。地面只是他筑巢休整零时的地方，渺小的身躯却完成在地球上最壮阔的候鸟冒险，祝他们一路顺风。明年四月见，也祝愿诸军都能飞到人生的平流层。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00001",
      "start_ms": 550,
      "end_ms": 950,
      "text": "Jj,"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1070,
      "end_ms": 1770,
      "text": "你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1890,
      "end_ms": 4170,
      "text": "世界上真的有一种没有脚的鸟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4370,
      "end_ms": 5670,
      "text": "它的一生一直在飞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6010,
      "end_ms": 6610,
      "text": "一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00006",
      "start_ms": 6610,
      "end_ms": 7510,
      "text": "只落一次地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00007",
      "start_ms": 7970,
      "end_ms": 9970,
      "text": "她是世界上最孤独的旅人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00008",
      "start_ms": 10070,
      "end_ms": 11650,
      "text": "也是最长情的信徒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00009",
      "start_ms": 11870,
      "end_ms": 13270,
      "text": "她叫北京雨燕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00010",
      "start_ms": 13570,
      "end_ms": 16150,
      "text": "就是当年北京奥运吉祥物妮妮的原型，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16350,
      "end_ms": 16990,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00012",
      "start_ms": 17110,
      "end_ms": 20150,
      "text": "燕子南飞其实不是飞到我国的南方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00013",
      "start_ms": 20250,
      "end_ms": 21830,
      "text": "而是一直飞到南非。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00014",
      "start_ms": 22050,
      "end_ms": 22430,
      "text": "没错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00015",
      "start_ms": 22550,
      "end_ms": 25470,
      "text": "非洲南部什么补给装备都没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00016",
      "start_ms": 25510,
      "end_ms": 29010,
      "text": "凭借一双小小的翅膀就出发了我们的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00017",
      "start_ms": 29050,
      "end_ms": 30700,
      "text": "北京雨燕一入秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00018",
      "start_ms": 30700,
      "end_ms": 32500,
      "text": "这几天已经陆续出发了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00019",
      "start_ms": 32760,
      "end_ms": 38660,
      "text": "他们可以在空中连续飞行十个月不落地睡觉、吃饭交配都在空中进行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00020",
      "start_ms": 39040,
      "end_ms": 40520,
      "text": "即便身体仍在飞行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00021",
      "start_ms": 40520,
      "end_ms": 42140,
      "text": "他的大脑却能陷入沉睡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00022",
      "start_ms": 42460,
      "end_ms": 43640,
      "text": "他们从北京出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00023",
      "start_ms": 43660,
      "end_ms": 45260,
      "text": "经过蒙古到达中亚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00024",
      "start_ms": 45280,
      "end_ms": 46619,
      "text": "再穿越阿拉伯沙漠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00025",
      "start_ms": 46640,
      "end_ms": 47460,
      "text": "渡过红海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00026",
      "start_ms": 47540,
      "end_ms": 49740,
      "text": "最终抵达南非高原海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00027",
      "start_ms": 49740,
      "end_ms": 51480,
      "text": "不到一颗鸡蛋大的重量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00028",
      "start_ms": 51520,
      "end_ms": 52680,
      "text": "飞越欧亚大陆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00029",
      "start_ms": 52720,
      "end_ms": 54280,
      "text": "全程飞行三万里路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00030",
      "start_ms": 54340,
      "end_ms": 55840,
      "text": "经过三十七个国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00031",
      "start_ms": 56120,
      "end_ms": 57400,
      "text": "里约一夫一妻制，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00032",
      "start_ms": 57440,
      "end_ms": 58780,
      "text": "终身只有一个半围，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00033",
      "start_ms": 58920,
      "end_ms": 61335,
      "text": "夫妻双方一起穿也山川荒漠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00034",
      "start_ms": 61670,
      "end_ms": 63410,
      "text": "而今年刚出生的雨燕宝宝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00035",
      "start_ms": 63570,
      "end_ms": 66210,
      "text": "要先于父母一步独自前往非洲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00036",
      "start_ms": 66430,
      "end_ms": 68530,
      "text": "从此和父母山高水远，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00037",
      "start_ms": 68710,
      "end_ms": 69575,
      "text": "不再相见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00038",
      "start_ms": 70010,
      "end_ms": 70530,
      "text": "在路上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00039",
      "start_ms": 70530,
      "end_ms": 72430,
      "text": "他们要面对的是天敌的捕食，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00040",
      "start_ms": 72430,
      "end_ms": 73490,
      "text": "是恶劣的天气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00041",
      "start_ms": 73690,
      "end_ms": 76735,
      "text": "唯一可以依靠的是不返航的勇气和信念。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00042",
      "start_ms": 77140,
      "end_ms": 79480,
      "text": "那你知道雨燕为什么能够不落地吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00043",
      "start_ms": 79580,
      "end_ms": 80620,
      "text": "一直到最近几年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00044",
      "start_ms": 80620,
      "end_ms": 82675,
      "text": "科学家才发现了一个惊人的秘密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00045",
      "start_ms": 82930,
      "end_ms": 85705,
      "text": "他们的飞行高度竟然接近了平流层。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00046",
      "start_ms": 86050,
      "end_ms": 87950,
      "text": "大部分生物都生活在对流层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00047",
      "start_ms": 88130,
      "end_ms": 89785,
      "text": "我们会受到重力的拖拽。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00048",
      "start_ms": 90080,
      "end_ms": 91300,
      "text": "比如在坐飞机的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00049",
      "start_ms": 91300,
      "end_ms": 92380,
      "text": "一旦突破颠簸了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00050",
      "start_ms": 92380,
      "end_ms": 95485,
      "text": "对流层就会在平流层开启定速巡航。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00051",
      "start_ms": 95950,
      "end_ms": 97250,
      "text": "而在平流层的雨燕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00052",
      "start_ms": 97430,
      "end_ms": 99190,
      "text": "它不需要剧烈的煽动翅膀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00053",
      "start_ms": 99330,
      "end_ms": 101940,
      "text": "它只需要稍微张开双翼风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00054",
      "start_ms": 101940,
      "end_ms": 103675,
      "text": "就会拖着他往前飞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00055",
      "start_ms": 104260,
      "end_ms": 106540,
      "text": "雨燕在空中飞行的状态很像鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00056",
      "start_ms": 106540,
      "end_ms": 108795,
      "text": "在水里水的浮力会拖着它。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00057",
      "start_ms": 109060,
      "end_ms": 111075,
      "text": "我们的人生就像在对流层飞行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00058",
      "start_ms": 111320,
      "end_ms": 112540,
      "text": "这里有太多的干扰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00059",
      "start_ms": 112780,
      "end_ms": 113720,
      "text": "情绪的风暴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00060",
      "start_ms": 113760,
      "end_ms": 115675,
      "text": "信息的噪音、拥挤的竞争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00061",
      "start_ms": 115980,
      "end_ms": 117635,
      "text": "大家都在同一高度盘旋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00062",
      "start_ms": 117920,
      "end_ms": 118760,
      "text": "互相碰撞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00063",
      "start_ms": 118860,
      "end_ms": 119735,
      "text": "互相消耗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00064",
      "start_ms": 120080,
      "end_ms": 122970,
      "text": "如果你一旦飞到了人生的平流层在那里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00065",
      "start_ms": 122970,
      "end_ms": 123930,
      "text": "情绪更稳定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00066",
      "start_ms": 124130,
      "end_ms": 125225,
      "text": "环境更安静，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00067",
      "start_ms": 125510,
      "end_ms": 128845,
      "text": "你不再通过剧烈的自我损耗的方式去换取成功。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00068",
      "start_ms": 129210,
      "end_ms": 131170,
      "text": "你会发现天空其实很宽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00069",
      "start_ms": 131470,
      "end_ms": 133045,
      "text": "气流其实很温柔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00070",
      "start_ms": 133400,
      "end_ms": 135085,
      "text": "人生是不需要过分努力的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00071",
      "start_ms": 135300,
      "end_ms": 138450,
      "text": "你只需要不断的去筛选匹配自己的环境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00072",
      "start_ms": 138650,
      "end_ms": 140470,
      "text": "然后让自己放松下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00073",
      "start_ms": 140590,
      "end_ms": 141675,
      "text": "闲下来就可以。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00074",
      "start_ms": 142080,
      "end_ms": 143325,
      "text": "就像北京语言一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00075",
      "start_ms": 143550,
      "end_ms": 144635,
      "text": "推到他的平流层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00076",
      "start_ms": 145110,
      "end_ms": 146625,
      "text": "天空才是他真正的家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00077",
      "start_ms": 146890,
      "end_ms": 149535,
      "text": "地面只是他筑巢休整零时的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00078",
      "start_ms": 149970,
      "end_ms": 153555,
      "text": "渺小的身躯却完成在地球上最壮阔的候鸟冒险，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00079",
      "start_ms": 154000,
      "end_ms": 155140,
      "text": "祝他们一路顺风。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00080",
      "start_ms": 155280,
      "end_ms": 156440,
      "text": "明年四月见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_abf33f113a520cdb_s00081",
      "start_ms": 156580,
      "end_ms": 159755,
      "text": "也祝愿诸军都能飞到人生的平流层。"
    }
  ],
